@@ -26,6 +26,8 @@
  * 7 (0323): the TAS2557 amps (bsd/dev/taimen_tas2557.c over taimen_i2c.c, BLSP2 QUP1): reset, program
  *   0, configuration 0, calibration, ASI 24-bit, powered down; up with the bit clock (the tone,
  *   sessions), down before it stops. The port runs S24_LE in 32-bit slots (3.072 MHz) as Android.
